  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "6D0B8D6CEA518AD5",
      "text": "關於道館測驗的細節，\\n只要到外面去[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就會知道囉。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_00",
      "hash64": "E12A2E57CA10DF5E",
      "text": "各位看官！\\n奇樹奇述直播的時～間～到～！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_01",
      "hash64": "E12A2F57CA10E111",
      "text": "嗨！你好我好大家好～！[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_02",
      "hash64": "E12A2C57CA10DBF8",
      "text": "吸睛電網捕捉你的眼睛！\\n誰在奇述？是我奇樹！\\r\\n是個道館館主喔！早午晚安哈囉Ciao！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_select_01",
      "hash64": "09252C6E0C8AF7B4",
      "text": "道館館主！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_select_02",
      "hash64": "09252F6E0C8AFCCD",
      "text": "早午晚安哈囉Ciao！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03a",
      "hash64": "AB88D62C5AA8DE3E",
      "text": "我是奇樹！不只是個道館館主，\\n還是個把影片上傳到網路來\\r\\n傳播夢想的網路紅人！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03b",
      "hash64": "AB88D52C5AA8DC8B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的奇樹語很溜嘛！\\n想不到[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一點都不怯場耶～！？[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_03",
      "hash64": "E12A2D57CA10DDAB",
      "text": "事出突然，可能讓[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳嚇了一跳。\\n不過！當下的這個狀況……\\r\\n正在向全世界直播喔～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_04",
      "hash64": "E12A3257CA10E62A",
      "text": "這位挑戰者～！謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳為了見我，\\n一路來到釀光道館！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_05",
      "hash64": "E12A3357CA10E7DD",
      "text": "我超～～～級高興的。\\n但是畢竟我有點小名氣，\\r\\n所以是個大～忙人喔～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_06",
      "hash64": "E12A3057CA10E2C4",
      "text": "所以我只和能讓影片爆紅的……\\c\\n噢不，所以我只能和充滿熱情的\\n對手合作呢。唉……[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_07",
      "hash64": "E12A3157CA10E477",
      "text": "……事情就是這樣！\\n如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳想和我對戰的話，\\r\\n就幫我炒熱這個節目吧！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_08",
      "hash64": "E12A2657CA10D1C6",
      "text": "看[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳幹勁十足的嘛！\\n那我就要開始說明這個企劃囉！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_20",
      "hash64": "E1232257CA0AAC4C",
      "text": "街頭紳士，請上場～！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_head_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "3DA8B550A77FB5A5",
      "text": "哎呀，[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學，\\n這真是一場奇遇。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_09",
      "hash64": "E12A2757CA10D379",
      "text": "咦～！什麼什麼？\\n難不成你們互相認識？[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_17",
      "hash64": "E12DB157CA13F3CE",
      "text": "這位紳士走在街頭的氣場真不是蓋的，\\n讓我忍不住挖了他來上節目呢！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_head_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "3DA8B250A77FB08C",
      "text": "不敢當，不敢當。哈哈哈……[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_18",
      "hash64": "E12DAC57CA13EB4F",
      "text": "接下來，就要請挑戰者[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n和這位紳士來一場\\r\\n捉迷藏！！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_10",
      "hash64": "E12DB457CA13F8E7",
      "text": "如果能用街頭攝影機找到街頭紳士３次，\\n道館測驗就算及格！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_11",
      "hash64": "E12DB357CA13F734",
      "text": "這場捉迷藏就叫做……\\c\\n「找找看！我在哪兒呢！？\\n　尋找街頭紳士！」[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_12",
      "hash64": "E12DB657CA13FC4D",
      "text": "……這個企劃名稱沒問題吧？\\n應該沒有違反什麼有的沒的吧？[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_denki_13",
      "hash64": "E12DB557CA13FA9A",
      "text": "哎，不管啦！那奇好～\\n街頭紳士，請先去準備吧！[VAR 0x0114(0019)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_denki_015_head_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "3DA8B350A77FB23F",
      "text": "寶可夢聯盟平時總是幫助我們，\\n幫這個忙這也算是報恩。\\r\\n……還請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳手下留情了。[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
